{"title":"AI Clinic 03: Kill the task you hate most","startsAt":"2026-11-18T18:00:00-05:00","endsAt":"2026-11-18T20:00:00-05:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"Pick the job you would pay money never to do again. That one.\n\nBring it to the room and leave knowing whether it is an evening, a weekend, or a real project, and what the first step is either way.\n\nSame clinic format. Everyone names theirs, the board sorts them into **do it yourself this week**, **a weekend project**, or **needs help, or not worth doing**, and three or four get taken apart properly: approach, tool, rough cost, what breaks, who should build it.\n\nEvery bottleneck in the room gets sorted out loud and gets a first step. Some of these are a ten minute job, some are a real project, and some are not worth doing. You will be told which.\n\nNobody gets sold to and nobody gets told their problem is too small. The small ones are usually the ones that go first.\n\n**The night**\n\n* 6:00 Doors, coffee, write your bottleneck on a card\n* 6:15 Round the table, sixty seconds each\n* 6:35 The board\n* 6:50 Three or four worked through properly\n* 7:20 Networking\n* 8:00 Out\n\n**Who should come**\n\nOwners and operators across the west GTA. Especially useful if you have already tried something, been underwhelmed, and assumed the whole category was overhyped.\n\n**What to bring**\n\nThe worst one. No laptop.\n\n**Cost** Free.\n\n**When:** Wednesday 18 November 2026, 6:00 to 8:00 pm.\n\n**Where:** 30 Topflight Drive, Mississauga. Follow the signs to the offices when you arrive. Doors at 6:00, and it is worth being there for the round the table at 6:15 because that is where your bottleneck goes on the board.","venue":{"name":"30 Topflight Drive","address":"30 Topflight Dr., Mississauga","lat":43.65024,"lng":-79.71096,"city":"Mississauga"},"fee":null,"group":"Build with AI, Mississauga","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/b/c/7/9/highres_535608249.jpeg"}